ogs): hide generic status description for ordinary executions in log details (#9639)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\ne9b1e80\nfix(mcp-logs): remove duplicate LLM request ID from log detail Request Details (#9638)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\nb21ba0c\nCommits on Nov 4, 2026\ntest(mcp): add INF-78 to INF-80, AUTH-64, PUD-87 to PUD-90 and GO-37 e2e harness tests (#9623)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\n0099f44\nfeat(mcp): collapse code mode binding level and limits into an accordion in MCP settings (#9622)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\ndf9ceb8\ntest(mcp): add PUD-82 to PUD-86 e2e harness tests for virtual-key grants and session ID handling (#9615)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\n40a945f\nrefactor(mcp): move upstream OAuth e2e helpers into the shared harness library (#9608)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\na54f9f5\ntest(mcp): add AUTH-59 to AUTH-63 and ADM-88 e2e harness tests for OAuth reauthorization and header key changes (#9607)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\nc02bbb7\nfix(mcp): allow OAuth clients registered without the refresh_token grant to refresh tokens (#9606)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\n6062344\nrefactor(mcp-harness): extract shared collection builder helpers into lib/mcp-harness.mjs (#9605)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\nd383339\ntest(mcp): add per-user discovery isolation tests for shared virtual keys and parallel callers (#9568)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\n7d13a46\ntest(mcp): add PUD-72 to PUD-81 e2e harness tests for per-caller tool isolation (#9567)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\nab1f5f0\nfeat(mcp): toggle tool parameters between table and JSON views and inline the View more toggle (#9566)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\nbb88ae3\nfeat(mcp-registry): make client name a keyboard-accessible button and drop \"View details\" from the actions menu (#9565)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\na7cd4eb\nfeat(mcp): collapse failure details, expand long descriptions, and hide TLS for plain HTTP in view sheet (#9564)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\n3c4a16b\nfix(mcp): reword pending per-user server alerts and offer a new-client reregister after a failed verify sign-in (#9563)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\ncd288c8\nfix(ui): verify a per-user OAuth server after per-user discovery is turned off (#9562)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\n3f3db87\nfix(mcp): send a per-user OAuth server back to pending verification when per-user discovery is turned off (#9561)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\naf28349\ntest(mcpconsole): let the mock authorization server forget the clients it registered (#9560)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\na8093b5\nCommits on Nov 2, 2026\nrefactor(mcp): export DialBootMCPClients and accept an injectable reconnect function (#9513)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\n1612883\nfix(mcp): refresh a per-call credential once when the upstream rejects it at the handshake (#9415)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\nee19c8b\ntest(mcp): bind e2e harness Bifrost server to 127.0.0.1 (#9512)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\n637000c\ntest(mcp): refuse browser requests carrying an Origin header on chaosmock control surfaces (#9511)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\nb69f0bf\ntest(mcp): add e2e harness tests for per-user discovery (#9414)\nPratham-Mishra04\nauthored\nc5f2045\nPreviousNext",
